97
00:04:47,884 --> 00:04:49,732
Time for our Warning Sign of the Week.

98
00:04:50,082 --> 00:04:54,498
If your steering feels heavy or a warning
light appears, get it checked immediately.

99
00:04:54,848 --> 00:04:56,960
Ignoring it can lead to loss of control.

100
00:04:57,310 --> 00:04:59,110
Especially at high speeds.

101
00:04:59,459 --> 00:05:02,435
Another sign is a vibrating steering wheel
on smooth roads.

102
00:05:02,785 --> 00:05:05,905
That can indicate a worn EPS sensor or
motor.

103
00:05:06,255 --> 00:05:08,991
Also watch for a pulling sensation to one
side.

104
00:05:09,341 --> 00:05:11,525
That can mean a misaligned steering rack.

105
00:05:11,875 --> 00:05:13,531
Regular alignment checks help.

106
00:05:13,881 --> 00:05:14,625
Exactly.

